.mp4?t=1692189927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25baFORGET TRIGGER DISCIPLINE\u25c4</strong></h2>Knock yourself out, go through the entire available arsenal of non-lethal weapons - from a squirt gun to an egg launching slingshot. Just pick up a weapon and obliterate all the other chickens! Stun 'em with a hammer, punch with a boxing glove and skedaddle using a pocket teleport - this is just a little sneak peek of all the special moves available in the game. Bamboozle your opponent and watch your back, don't get outsmarted yourself.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989770/extras/db4906c093f59f9182887962c28044f9.poster.avif?t=1692189927\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989770/extras/db4906c093f59f9182887962c28044f9.webm?t=1692189927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989770/extras/db4906c093f59f9182887962c28044f9.mp4?t=1692189927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25baPUT YOUR GUN DOWN FOR A SEC\u25c4</strong></h2>Participate in both the standard battles, and in rounds with special rules. Earn extra points in additional competitions where shooting accuracy is not that important.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989770/extras/f1a7baf23cd2599aac80708cb8bcf882.poster.avif?t=1692189927\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989770/extras/f1a7baf23cd2599aac80708cb8bcf882.webm?t=1692189927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989770/extras/f1a7baf23cd2599aac80708cb8bcf882.mp4?t=1692189927\" type=\"vide